{%- comment -%}
  Check mark as a CSS url() value (data URI) for a custom property, used as a checkbox
  background: style="--icon: {{ icon | strip | escape }}".
  A CSS background image cannot use currentColor, so the stroke color (#fff) is fixed here.
  Usage: {% render 'jp-icon-check', format: 'css' %}
  Accepts:
  - format: 'css'. The snippet only has the CSS output; the parameter documents the intent.
{%- endcomment -%}
